{"overview":"تاکمیچی هاناکی فریلنسر است که به عمق ناامیدی رسیده است. می‌فهمد تنها دوست‌دخترش در دورهٔ متوسطه، هیناتا تاچی‌بانا، توسط باند بی‌رحم توکیو مانجی کشته شده است. روز پس از شنیدن خبر مرگ او، بر روی سکو ایستگاه ایستاده و توسط جمعیتی به ریل‌ها هل داده می‌شود. چشم‌هایش را می‌بندد فکر می‌کند می‌میرد، اما وقتی دوباره باز می‌کند، به‌طوری عجیب به ۱۲ سال پیش بازگشته است. حالا که دوباره در بهترین روزهای زندگی‌اش زندگی می‌کند، تاکمیچی تصمیم می‌گیرد انتقام‌جویی کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Takemichi Hanagaki is a freelancer that’s reached the absolute pits of despair in his life. He finds out that the only girlfriend he ever had, in middle school, Hinata Tachibana, had been killed by the ruthless Tokyo Manji Gang. The day after hearing about her death, he’s standing on the station platform and ends up being pushed over onto the tracks by a herd of people. He closes his eyes thinking he’s about to die, but when he opens his eyes back up, he somehow had gone back in time 12 years. Now that he’s back living the best days of his life, Takemichi decides to get revenge on his life.","tagline_en":"I'm not gonna let you die.","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":44,"y":2021,"poster":"/7BRtAyw86UXVuUZQOp1LmDPEu8p.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":55,"y":2021,"poster":"/yq7MAqDqfmPToIH4v2CCK380bK7.jpg"}],"episodes":55,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"新祐樹","role":"Takemichi Hanagaki (voice)","photo":"/pyOAlLSA9ZabbVy5HD8j9QuUdV8.jpg","en":"Yuuki Shin"},{"name":"和氣あず未","role":"Hinata Tachibana (voice)","photo":"/nxm4DLWv0BOcK2owvAz5yafSAXj.jpg","en":"Azumi Waki"},{"name":"逢坂良太","role":"Naoto Tachibana (voice)","photo":"/d2TGy8Qkxe90tGDr9MCXFGkhbPl.jpg","en":"Ryota Osaka"},{"name":"林勇","role":"Manjiro 'Mikey' Sano (voice)","photo":"/tCABSsjU9fWZqTtOAGTGcUnEF2p.jpg","en":"Yuu Hayashi"},{"name":"تاتسوهیسا سوزوکی","role":"Ken 'Doraken' Ryuguji (voice)","photo":"/foytL2OreKzQcTNftz2qMgClKKg.jpg","en":"Tatsuhisa S